Fuil
$cards
DECK 8 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 78 DEAL TUSOB
TUSOB 6 FACE_LAST
TUSOB 9 FACE_LAST
TUSOB 7 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
TUSOB 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE_STACK TUSOB TUSOB
OR
    AND
        SRC Suit {HEARTS, DIAMONDS}
        DEST Rank K
    AND
        SRCSTACK Rank ascending
        SRCSTACK Size == 3
DRAW
PILE ALL TUSOB Size > 0
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL TUSOB Empty
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
